  availableTopics:
  - topicName: So, how did the heist go?
    requiredDay: 0
    requiredStoryFlags:
    - Rachel_Got_Speed
    excludedStoryFlags: []
    flagsToSet: []
    requiredPreviousTopic: 
    lines:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: Another easy victory. That old hag had no idea what hit her~
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: "PLEASE don\u2019t tell me you robbed a nursing home..."
      effect: 1
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: "What?! No!... I mean, that\u2019s not a bad idea now that you-"
      effect: 3
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: DO NOT.
      effect: 1
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: Alright, alright... I robbed that oracle lady a few trees over.
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: ... What could you possibly get from an oracle.
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: I stole her orb of pondering. Those things fetch a real good price~
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: ... I think I hate you
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: I get that a lot.
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
  - topicName: Why did you come back?
    requiredDay: 0
    requiredStoryFlags:
    - Rachel_Day2_Fail
    - Rachel_Got_Speed
    excludedStoryFlags: []
    flagsToSet: []
    requiredPreviousTopic: So, how did the heist go?
    lines:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: "Well for one thing I told you I\u2019d tell you about the heist. I may
        be a thief, but I keep my promises."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: "You promised you\u2019d pay me yesterday"
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: You promised a good drink!
      effect: 1
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: "You didn\u2019t tell me what you wanted!"
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: "You\u2019re a bartender. You need social skills! Or at least to read
        your own menu."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: "This time I want a sweet drink with pepper in it. If you mess up, you\u2019re
        never seeing a payment from me."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
  - topicName: Why did you come back?
    requiredDay: 0
    requiredStoryFlags:
    - Rachel_Got_Speed
    excludedStoryFlags:
    - Rachel_Day2_Fail
    flagsToSet: []
    requiredPreviousTopic: So, how did the heist go?
    lines:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: "Well for one thing I told you I\u2019d tell you about the heist. I may
        be a thief, but I keep my promises."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: "Plus, the drinks here are nice. I can\u2019t say no to something that
        makes me feel good."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: Fair enough. You want the same thing again?
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: Nah, I want something sweet so I can prolong the taste of my victory
        last night~
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
  - topicName: Any plans now?
    requiredDay: 0
    requiredStoryFlags: []
    excludedStoryFlags: []
    flagsToSet: []
    requiredPreviousTopic: Why did you come back?
    lines:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: Well I need to sell my catch from last night.
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: Who would buy a clearly stolen item?
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: "I know a guy. He\u2019s not the easiest to work with."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: But with enough of my natural charm, I can fetch a high price for anything~
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
  - topicName: What do you want?
    requiredDay: 0
    requiredStoryFlags:
    - Rachel_Got_Speed
    excludedStoryFlags: []
    flagsToSet: []
    requiredPreviousTopic: Any plans now?
    lines:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: "I need something with a good bit of spice in it. Nothing that\u2019ll
        hurt too much though."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: "I\u2019ll see what I can do."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
  - topicName: What happend?
    requiredDay: 0
    requiredStoryFlags: []
    excludedStoryFlags:
    - Rachel_Got_Speed
    flagsToSet: []
    requiredPreviousTopic: 
    lines:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: I failed the heist...
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: "Well you can\u2019t expect to succeed at everything... especially when
        you probably shouldn\u2019t do it."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: "I\u2019ve failed before don\u2019t get me wrong, but I wasn\u2019t caught
        by the cops."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: Oh? Who got you then?
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: The lady I was robbing, the oracle a few trees down from here
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: ... You tried to steal from an oracle? What did you expect to get from
        that!
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: "That doesn\u2019t matter right now!"
      effect: 1
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: "... The lady grabbed me by the arm and told me, \u201CYou will die over
        petty change\u201D so I noped out of there."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: Yeesh. Have you considered doing something more rewarding?
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: "I\u2019ve heard those prophecies can easily be changed by changing your
        behavior."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: I... wait you might be onto something...
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: "I think there\u2019s a job opening at the grocery store."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: You could also get an education or-
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: I can steal treasures...
      effect: 2
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: ...what.
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: "If she thinks I\u2019ll die over petty change, then I\u2019ll stop taking
        petty change!"
      effect: 1
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: "I already know exactly what I\u2019m going to do as well!"
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: I should start writing things down, do you have a pen?
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: Oh no...
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
  - topicName: What do you want?
    requiredDay: 0
    requiredStoryFlags: []
    excludedStoryFlags: []
    flagsToSet: []
    requiredPreviousTopic: 
    lines:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: Something sweet. I need a taste of my victory to motivate myself even
